Backport of upstream ec74136ded79 ("binder: create node flag to request
sender's security context", Todd Kjos, Linux 5.0) to Sony's NW-A105/ZX507
kernel 4.14.78 (GPL source 20211022, vendor/nxp-opensource/kernel_imx).
Hand-ported around the Android RT-priority binder changes. Also bounds the
scatter-gather buffer area below the security context, which upstream did in
the follow-up "binder: fix BUG_ON found by selinux-testsuite".

Needed because A10+ keystore2 refuses every request without calling_sid.

